e_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106732","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106732.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106732.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:18Z"},"body":"All calls to `draw_command_begin_label` within the rendering servers no longer allocate a `String` each time it is called **when capture tools are disabled**. This would be the expected case for production. The `String` API is still available for `GDScript` and GDExtensions.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> Metal was worse that Windows or Linux, as it always returned `true` that debug capture was enabled\r\n\r\n- [x] Add allocation profiles demonstrating the before, after and when capture is disabled.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> Tested with the Bistro demo, running for 500 frames to be consistent across runs.\r\n\r\n| When | Capture Enabled? | Total Allocations | Instruments Preview |\r\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\r\n| Before (Metal) | N | 33,978 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea8b1b04-2481-4968-adb9-2365e58fbe9c\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| Before (Win / Linux) | N | 16,941 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d12b1d1a-6a2f-4584-8a57-b3fb841e8c26\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| After (all) | N | 0 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54e05be9-0072-420c-8a26-335b3f5cb369\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| After (all) | Y | 28 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3f59aa5-1646-4e7a-84f4-470c1358ae00\" width=\"200px\" /> |","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use